## 9. Smart Comments

```typescript
// ❌ Useless comments — restating the code
// Increment counter by 1
counter++;

// Get user from database
const user = await getUser(id);

// ✅ Useful comments — explaining WHY, not WHAT
// We use optimistic locking here because concurrent edits
// caused data loss in production (incident #247)
const updated = await db.post.update({
  where: { id, version: currentVersion },
  data: { ...changes, version: { increment: 1 } },
});

// Rate limit is set to 5/min because the downstream payment
// provider enforces a 10/min limit and we need headroom
const PAYMENT_RATE_LIMIT = 5;
```

